      "slide": 2,
      "blocks": [
        [
          "Anticipating fluctuations in retail volumes can help businesses prepare for economic and geopolitical disruptions."
        ],
        [
          "Why forecast FMCG retail demand? "
        ],
        [
          "The challenge"
        ],
        [
          "Operational efficiency"
        ],
        [
          "Managing uncertainty"
        ],
        [
          "More accurate forecasts can support inventory management, procurement and supply-chain planning. "
        ],
        [
          "Anticipating changes in retail volumes can support better business decisions, particularly in uncertain economic environments."
        ],
        [
          "Monthly retail growth is difficult to predict, especially when relevant economic data becomes available with a delay. "
        ],
        [
          "Research question:"
        ],
        [
          "Can macroeconomic indicators and geographically weighted conflict exposure improve monthly retail volume growth forecasts for food, beverages and tobacco beyond simple benchmarks?"
        ],
        [
          "Project overview:"
        ],
        [
          "5 countries"
