      "slide": 4,
      "blocks": [
        [
          "Forecasting methodology: Publication lags and out-of-sample evaluation"
        ],
        [
          "Economic and conflict data are not immediately available after their reference period. To avoid using information that would not have yet been published, predictors were shifted backward according to assumed reporting delays. "
        ],
        [
          "Retail growth & unemployment"
        ],
        [
          "3-month lag"
        ],
        [
          "Inflation & conflict exposure"
        ],
        [
          "2-month lag"
        ],
        [
          "GDP growth"
        ],
        [
          "Latest eligible quarter"
        ],
        [
          "Chronological evaluation"
        ],
        [
          "Training"
        ],
        [
          "Validation"
        ],
        [
          "Testing"
        ],
        [
          "2015-2022",
          "450 observations"
        ],
        [
          "2023"
        ],
        [
          "2024-2025"
        ],
        [
          "Expanding-window forecasting"
        ],
        [
          "Models were re-estimated as newly available historical observations entered the training window, while the forecasting specifications remained fixed during testing."
