      "slide": 10,
      "blocks": [
        [
          "1) "
        ],
        [
          "Short evaluation period"
        ],
        [
          "2)"
        ],
        [
          "Retrospective data limitations"
        ],
        [
          "Limitations & Conclusion"
        ],
        [
          "Testing covers only 24 months, with possible common shocks across countries, limiting confidence in the observed differences."
        ],
        [
          "Revised historical values, approximate publication lags and differing conflict sources limit how closely the exercise reflects real-time forecasting."
        ],
        [
          "Annual finalized and monthly preliminary conflict records differ in accuracy. Distance to capital cities may not fully capture economic exposure."
        ],
        [
          "3)"
        ],
        [
          "Conflict measurement"
        ],
        [
          "Conclusion: "
        ],
        [
          "Limited predictive gains: No developed model outperformed zero growth during validation. Small improvements in testing suggest that greater model complexity and conflict indicators offer no consistent forecasting advantage."
        ]
